{"ayah/62-1.html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"id\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Tafsir Al-Jumu&#x27;a 62:1 — menurut Ibnu Taimiyah dan Ibnul Qayyim</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Apa yang ada di langit dan apa yang ada di bumi senantiasa bertasbih kepada Allah. Maharaja, Yang Mahasuci, Yang Mahaperkasa, Mahabijaksana.\">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/ayah/62-1.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ar\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/62-1.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"x-default\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/62-1.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"en\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/en/ayah/62-1.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ur\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ur/ayah/62-1.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"id\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/ayah/62-1.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"tr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/ayah/62-1.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fr/ayah/62-1.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"bn\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/bn/ayah/62-1.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ms\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ms/ayah/62-1.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fa\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fa/ayah/62-1.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ru\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ru/ayah/62-1.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"sw\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/sw/ayah/62-1.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ha\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/ayah/62-1.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"es\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/es/ayah/62-1.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"de\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/de/ayah/62-1.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"zh\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/zh/ayah/62-1.html\">\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Tafsir Al-Jumu&#x27;a 62:1 — menurut Ibnu Taimiyah dan Ibnul Qayyim\">\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Apa yang ada di langit dan apa yang ada di bumi senantiasa bertasbih kepada Allah. Maharaja, Yang Mahasuci, Yang Mahaperkasa, Mahabijaksana.\">\n<meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#1f4d3a\">\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/og.png\">\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\">\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"Beranda\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"Surah Al-Jumu'a\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/surah/62.html\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 3, \"name\": \"Ayat 1\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/ayah/62-1.html\"}]}</script>\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.svg\" type=\"image/svg+xml\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Amiri+Quran&family=Amiri:wght@400;700&family=Noto+Naskh+Arabic:wght@400;600&display=swap\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/theme.css\">\n<style>body{font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;color:var(--ink);padding:20px 16px 48px;line-height:1.6}.tr{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin:0}.cr{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.ar{direction:rtl;text-align:right}</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"sp\"><nav class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"/id/\">Beranda</a> › <a href=\"/id/surah/62.html\">Surah Al-Jumu&#x27;a</a> › Ayat 1</nav><h1>Tafsir Surah Al-Jumu&#x27;a 62:1</h1><p class=\"vt ar\" lang=\"ar\">﴿بِسْمِ اللَّهِ الرَّحْمَٰنِ الرَّحِيمِ يُسَبِّحُ لِلَّهِ مَا فِي السَّمَاوَاتِ وَمَا فِي الْأَرْضِ الْمَلِكِ الْقُدُّوسِ الْعَزِيزِ الْحَكِيمِ﴾</p><section><h3>Terjemah makna</h3><p class=\"tr\">Apa yang ada di langit dan apa yang ada di bumi senantiasa bertasbih kepada Allah. Maharaja, Yang Mahasuci, Yang Mahaperkasa, Mahabijaksana.</p><span class=\"cr\" dir=\"ltr\">Indonesian Translation - Ministry of Religious Affairs — v1.0.1 · QuranEnc.com</span></section><p class=\"cr\">Perkataan kedua imam disajikan dalam bahasa Arab aslinya, apa adanya, beserta rujukannya.</p><section><h2>Syaikhul Islam Ibnu Taimiyah</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">ونحو ذلك - من معاني ألوهيته وخضوع الكائنات وإسلامها له وافتقارها إليه وسؤالها إياه ودعاء الخلق إياه؛ إما دعاء عبادة وإما دعاء مسألة وإما دعاؤهما جميعا.<cite>«مجموع الفتاوى» 2/405</cite></blockquote></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=id#s62a1\">Buka di tafsir interaktif (teks lengkap)</a><div class=\"pn\"><span></span><a href=\"/id/ayah/62-2.html\">Ayat berikutnya (62:2)</a></div></main><footer class=\"site-foot\"><span>Tafsir al-Syaikhain · <a href=\"/id/\">Beranda</a> · <a href=\"/about.html\">Tentang proyek</a> · <a href=\"/privacy.html\">Privasi &amp; ketentuan</a></span><a href=\"https://doersadv.com\" rel=\"noopener\" dir=\"ltr\">Developed by Doers</a></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n","ayah/62-2.html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"id\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Tafsir Al-Jumu&#x27;a 62:2 — menurut Ibnu Taimiyah dan Ibnul Qayyim</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Dialah yang mengutus seorang Rasul kepada kaum yang buta huruf dari kalangan mereka sendiri, yang membacakan kepada mereka ayat-ayat-Nya, menyucikan (jiwa)\">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/ayah/62-2.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ar\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/62-2.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"x-default\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/62-2.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"en\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/en/ayah/62-2.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ur\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ur/ayah/62-2.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"id\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/ayah/62-2.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"tr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/ayah/62-2.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fr/ayah/62-2.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"bn\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/bn/ayah/62-2.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ms\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ms/ayah/62-2.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fa\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fa/ayah/62-2.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ru\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ru/ayah/62-2.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"sw\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/sw/ayah/62-2.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ha\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/ayah/62-2.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"es\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/es/ayah/62-2.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"de\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/de/ayah/62-2.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"zh\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/zh/ayah/62-2.html\">\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Tafsir Al-Jumu&#x27;a 62:2 — menurut Ibnu Taimiyah dan Ibnul Qayyim\">\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Dialah yang mengutus seorang Rasul kepada kaum yang buta huruf dari kalangan mereka sendiri, yang membacakan kepada mereka ayat-ayat-Nya, menyucikan (jiwa)\">\n<meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#1f4d3a\">\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/og.png\">\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\">\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"Beranda\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"Surah Al-Jumu'a\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/surah/62.html\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 3, \"name\": \"Ayat 2\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/ayah/62-2.html\"}]}</script>\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.svg\" type=\"image/svg+xml\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Amiri+Quran&family=Amiri:wght@400;700&family=Noto+Naskh+Arabic:wght@400;600&display=swap\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/theme.css\">\n<style>body{font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;color:var(--ink);padding:20px 16px 48px;line-height:1.6}.tr{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin:0}.cr{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.ar{direction:rtl;text-align:right}</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"sp\"><nav class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"/id/\">Beranda</a> › <a href=\"/id/surah/62.html\">Surah Al-Jumu&#x27;a</a> › Ayat 2</nav><h1>Tafsir Surah Al-Jumu&#x27;a 62:2</h1><p class=\"vt ar\" lang=\"ar\">﴿هُوَ الَّذِي بَعَثَ فِي الْأُمِّيِّينَ رَسُولًا مِّنْهُمْ يَتْلُو عَلَيْهِمْ آيَاتِهِ وَيُزَكِّيهِمْ وَيُعَلِّمُهُمُ الْكِتَابَ وَالْحِكْمَةَ وَإِن كَانُوا مِن قَبْلُ لَفِي ضَلَالٍ مُّبِينٍ﴾</p><section><h3>Terjemah makna</h3><p class=\"tr\">Dialah yang mengutus seorang Rasul kepada kaum yang buta huruf dari kalangan mereka sendiri, yang membacakan kepada mereka ayat-ayat-Nya, menyucikan (jiwa) mereka dan mengajarkan kepada mereka Kitab dan Hikmah (Sunah), meskipun sebelumnya, mereka benar-benar dalam kesesatan yang nyata,</p><span class=\"cr\" dir=\"ltr\">Indonesian Translation - Ministry of Religious Affairs — v1.0.1 · QuranEnc.com</span></section><p class=\"cr\">Perkataan kedua imam disajikan dalam bahasa Arab aslinya, apa adanya, beserta rujukannya.</p><section><h2>Syaikhul Islam Ibnu Taimiyah</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">والأميون يتناول العرب قاطبة دون أهل الكتاب.<cite>«مجموع الفتاوى» 16/190</cite></blockquote></section><section><h2>Imam Ibnul Qayyim</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">فإن تزكية النفوس مسلم إلى الرسل. وإنما بعثهم الله لهذه التزكية وولاهم إياها. وجعلها على أيديهم دعوة، وتعليما وبيانا، وإرشادا، لا خلقا ولا إلهاما.<cite>«مدارج السالكين بين منازل إياك نعبد وإياك نستعين» 2/300</cite></blockquote></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=id#s62a2\">Buka di tafsir interaktif (teks lengkap)</a><div class=\"pn\"><a href=\"/id/ayah/62-1.html\">Ayat sebelumnya (62:1)</a><a href=\"/id/ayah/62-3.html\">Ayat berikutnya (62:3)</a></div></main><footer class=\"site-foot\"><span>Tafsir al-Syaikhain · <a href=\"/id/\">Beranda</a> · <a href=\"/about.html\">Tentang proyek</a> · <a href=\"/privacy.html\">Privasi &amp; ketentuan</a></span><a href=\"https://doersadv.com\" rel=\"noopener\" dir=\"ltr\">Developed by Doers</a></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n","ayah/62-3.html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"id\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Tafsir Al-Jumu&#x27;a 62:3 — menurut Ibnu Taimiyah dan Ibnul Qayyim</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"dan (juga) kepada kaum yang lain dari mereka yang belum bertemu dengan mereka. Dan Dialah Yang Mahaperkasa, Mahabijaksana.\">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/ayah/62-3.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ar\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/62-3.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"x-default\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/62-3.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"en\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/en/ayah/62-3.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ur\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ur/ayah/62-3.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"id\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/ayah/62-3.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"tr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/ayah/62-3.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fr/ayah/62-3.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"bn\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/bn/ayah/62-3.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ms\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ms/ayah/62-3.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fa\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fa/ayah/62-3.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ru\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ru/ayah/62-3.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"sw\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/sw/ayah/62-3.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ha\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/ayah/62-3.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"es\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/es/ayah/62-3.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"de\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/de/ayah/62-3.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"zh\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/zh/ayah/62-3.html\">\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Tafsir Al-Jumu&#x27;a 62:3 — menurut Ibnu Taimiyah dan Ibnul Qayyim\">\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"dan (juga) kepada kaum yang lain dari mereka yang belum bertemu dengan mereka. Dan Dialah Yang Mahaperkasa, Mahabijaksana.\">\n<meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#1f4d3a\">\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/og.png\">\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\">\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"Beranda\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"Surah Al-Jumu'a\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/surah/62.html\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 3, \"name\": \"Ayat 3\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/ayah/62-3.html\"}]}</script>\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.svg\" type=\"image/svg+xml\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Amiri+Quran&family=Amiri:wght@400;700&family=Noto+Naskh+Arabic:wght@400;600&display=swap\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/theme.css\">\n<style>body{font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;color:var(--ink);padding:20px 16px 48px;line-height:1.6}.tr{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin:0}.cr{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.ar{direction:rtl;text-align:right}</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"sp\"><nav class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"/id/\">Beranda</a> › <a href=\"/id/surah/62.html\">Surah Al-Jumu&#x27;a</a> › Ayat 3</nav><h1>Tafsir Surah Al-Jumu&#x27;a 62:3</h1><p class=\"vt ar\" lang=\"ar\">﴿وَآخَرِينَ مِنْهُمْ لَمَّا يَلْحَقُوا بِهِمْ وَهُوَ الْعَزِيزُ الْحَكِيمُ﴾</p><section><h3>Terjemah makna</h3><p class=\"tr\">dan (juga) kepada kaum yang lain dari mereka yang belum bertemu dengan mereka. Dan Dialah Yang Mahaperkasa, Mahabijaksana.</p><span class=\"cr\" dir=\"ltr\">Indonesian Translation - Ministry of Religious Affairs — v1.0.1 · QuranEnc.com</span></section><p class=\"cr\">Perkataan kedua imam disajikan dalam bahasa Arab aslinya, apa adanya, beserta rujukannya.</p><section><h2>Syaikhul Islam Ibnu Taimiyah</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">فهذا يتناول كل من دخل في الإسلام بعد دخول العرب فيه إلى يوم القيامة<cite>«مجموع الفتاوى» 16/190</cite></blockquote><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">فإن قوله {وآخرين منهم} أي في الدين دون النسب<cite>«مجموع الفتاوى» 16/190</cite></blockquote></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=id#s62a3\">Buka di tafsir interaktif (teks lengkap)</a><div class=\"pn\"><a href=\"/id/ayah/62-2.html\">Ayat sebelumnya (62:2)</a><a href=\"/id/ayah/62-5.html\">Ayat berikutnya (62:5)</a></div></main><footer class=\"site-foot\"><span>Tafsir al-Syaikhain · <a href=\"/id/\">Beranda</a> · <a href=\"/about.html\">Tentang proyek</a> · <a href=\"/privacy.html\">Privasi &amp; ketentuan</a></span><a href=\"https://doersadv.com\" rel=\"noopener\" dir=\"ltr\">Developed by Doers</a></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n","ayah/62-5.html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"id\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Tafsir Al-Jumu&#x27;a 62:5 — menurut Ibnu Taimiyah dan Ibnul Qayyim</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Perumpamaan orang-orang yang diberi tugas membawa Taurat, kemudian mereka tidak membawanya (tidak mengamalkannya) adalah seperti keledai yang membawa kitab\">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/ayah/62-5.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ar\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/62-5.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"x-default\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/62-5.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"en\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/en/ayah/62-5.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ur\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ur/ayah/62-5.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"id\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/ayah/62-5.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"tr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/ayah/62-5.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fr/ayah/62-5.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"bn\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/bn/ayah/62-5.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ms\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ms/ayah/62-5.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fa\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fa/ayah/62-5.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ru\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ru/ayah/62-5.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"sw\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/sw/ayah/62-5.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ha\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/ayah/62-5.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"es\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/es/ayah/62-5.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"de\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/de/ayah/62-5.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"zh\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/zh/ayah/62-5.html\">\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Tafsir Al-Jumu&#x27;a 62:5 — menurut Ibnu Taimiyah dan Ibnul Qayyim\">\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Perumpamaan orang-orang yang diberi tugas membawa Taurat, kemudian mereka tidak membawanya (tidak mengamalkannya) adalah seperti keledai yang membawa kitab\">\n<meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#1f4d3a\">\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/og.png\">\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\">\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"Beranda\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"Surah Al-Jumu'a\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/surah/62.html\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 3, \"name\": \"Ayat 5\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/ayah/62-5.html\"}]}</script>\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.svg\" type=\"image/svg+xml\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Amiri+Quran&family=Amiri:wght@400;700&family=Noto+Naskh+Arabic:wght@400;600&display=swap\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/theme.css\">\n<style>body{font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;color:var(--ink);padding:20px 16px 48px;line-height:1.6}.tr{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin:0}.cr{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.ar{direction:rtl;text-align:right}</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"sp\"><nav class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"/id/\">Beranda</a> › <a href=\"/id/surah/62.html\">Surah Al-Jumu&#x27;a</a> › Ayat 5</nav><h1>Tafsir Surah Al-Jumu&#x27;a 62:5</h1><p class=\"vt ar\" lang=\"ar\">﴿مَثَلُ الَّذِينَ حُمِّلُوا التَّوْرَاةَ ثُمَّ لَمْ يَحْمِلُوهَا كَمَثَلِ الْحِمَارِ يَحْمِلُ أَسْفَارًا بِئْسَ مَثَلُ الْقَوْمِ الَّذِينَ كَذَّبُوا بِآيَاتِ اللَّهِ وَاللَّهُ لَا يَهْدِي الْقَوْمَ الظَّالِمِينَ﴾</p><section><h3>Terjemah makna</h3><p class=\"tr\">Perumpamaan orang-orang yang diberi tugas membawa Taurat, kemudian mereka tidak membawanya (tidak mengamalkannya) adalah seperti keledai yang membawa kitab-kitab yang tebal. Sangat buruk perumpamaan kaum yang mendustakan ayat-ayat Allah. Dan Allah tidak memberi petunjuk kepada orang-orang yang zalim.</p><span class=\"cr\" dir=\"ltr\">Indonesian Translation - Ministry of Religious Affairs — v1.0.1 · QuranEnc.com</span></section><p class=\"cr\">Perkataan kedua imam disajikan dalam bahasa Arab aslinya, apa adanya, beserta rujukannya.</p><section><h2>Imam Ibnul Qayyim</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">فقاس من حمله سبحانه كتابه ليؤمن به ويتدبره ويعمل به ويدعو إليه ثم خالف ذلك ولم يحمله إلا على ظهر قلب<cite>«إعلام الموقعين عن رب العالمين» 1/127</cite></blockquote></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=id#s62a5\">Buka di tafsir interaktif (teks lengkap)</a><div class=\"pn\"><a href=\"/id/ayah/62-3.html\">Ayat sebelumnya (62:3)</a><a href=\"/id/ayah/62-9.html\">Ayat berikutnya (62:9)</a></div></main><footer class=\"site-foot\"><span>Tafsir al-Syaikhain · <a href=\"/id/\">Beranda</a> · <a href=\"/about.html\">Tentang proyek</a> · <a href=\"/privacy.html\">Privasi &amp; ketentuan</a></span><a href=\"https://doersadv.com\" rel=\"noopener\" dir=\"ltr\">Developed by Doers</a></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n","ayah/62-9.html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"id\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Tafsir Al-Jumu&#x27;a 62:9 — menurut Ibnu Taimiyah dan Ibnul Qayyim</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Wahai orang-orang yang beriman! Apabila telah diseru untuk melaksanakan salat pada hari Jumat, maka segeralah kamu mengingat Allah dan tinggalkanlah jual b\">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/ayah/62-9.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ar\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/62-9.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"x-default\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/62-9.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"en\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/en/ayah/62-9.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ur\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ur/ayah/62-9.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"id\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/ayah/62-9.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"tr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/ayah/62-9.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fr/ayah/62-9.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"bn\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/bn/ayah/62-9.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ms\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ms/ayah/62-9.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fa\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fa/ayah/62-9.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ru\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ru/ayah/62-9.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"sw\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/sw/ayah/62-9.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ha\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/ayah/62-9.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"es\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/es/ayah/62-9.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"de\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/de/ayah/62-9.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"zh\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/zh/ayah/62-9.html\">\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Tafsir Al-Jumu&#x27;a 62:9 — menurut Ibnu Taimiyah dan Ibnul Qayyim\">\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Wahai orang-orang yang beriman! Apabila telah diseru untuk melaksanakan salat pada hari Jumat, maka segeralah kamu mengingat Allah dan tinggalkanlah jual b\">\n<meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#1f4d3a\">\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/og.png\">\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\">\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"Beranda\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"Surah Al-Jumu'a\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/surah/62.html\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 3, \"name\": \"Ayat 9\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/ayah/62-9.html\"}]}</script>\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.svg\" type=\"image/svg+xml\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Amiri+Quran&family=Amiri:wght@400;700&family=Noto+Naskh+Arabic:wght@400;600&display=swap\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/theme.css\">\n<style>body{font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;color:var(--ink);padding:20px 16px 48px;line-height:1.6}.tr{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin:0}.cr{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.ar{direction:rtl;text-align:right}</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"sp\"><nav class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"/id/\">Beranda</a> › <a href=\"/id/surah/62.html\">Surah Al-Jumu&#x27;a</a> › Ayat 9</nav><h1>Tafsir Surah Al-Jumu&#x27;a 62:9</h1><p class=\"vt ar\" lang=\"ar\">﴿يَا أَيُّهَا الَّذِينَ آمَنُوا إِذَا نُودِيَ لِلصَّلَاةِ مِن يَوْمِ الْجُمُعَةِ فَاسْعَوْا إِلَىٰ ذِكْرِ اللَّهِ وَذَرُوا الْبَيْعَ ذَٰلِكُمْ خَيْرٌ لَّكُمْ إِن كُنتُمْ تَعْلَمُونَ﴾</p><section><h3>Terjemah makna</h3><p class=\"tr\">Wahai orang-orang yang beriman! Apabila telah diseru untuk melaksanakan salat pada hari Jumat, maka segeralah kamu mengingat Allah dan tinggalkanlah jual beli. Yang demikian itu lebih baik bagimu jika kamu mengetahui.</p><span class=\"cr\" dir=\"ltr\">Indonesian Translation - Ministry of Religious Affairs — v1.0.1 · QuranEnc.com</span></section><p class=\"cr\">Perkataan kedua imam disajikan dalam bahasa Arab aslinya, apa adanya, beserta rujukannya.</p><section><h2>Syaikhul Islam Ibnu Taimiyah</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">فجعل السعي إلى الصلاة سعيا إلى ذكر الله.<cite>«مجموع الفتاوى» 32/232</cite></blockquote><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">فما كان ملهيا وشاغلا عما أمر الله تعالى به من ذكره والصلاة له فهو منهي عنه؛ وإن لم يكن جنسه محرما: كالبيع؛ والعمل في التجارة وغير ذلك.<cite>«مجموع الفتاوى» 32/235</cite></blockquote></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=id#s62a9\">Buka di tafsir interaktif (teks lengkap)</a><div class=\"pn\"><a href=\"/id/ayah/62-5.html\">Ayat sebelumnya (62:5)</a><a href=\"/id/ayah/62-10.html\">Ayat berikutnya (62:10)</a></div></main><footer class=\"site-foot\"><span>Tafsir al-Syaikhain · <a href=\"/id/\">Beranda</a> · <a href=\"/about.html\">Tentang proyek</a> · <a href=\"/privacy.html\">Privasi &amp; ketentuan</a></span><a href=\"https://doersadv.com\" rel=\"noopener\" dir=\"ltr\">Developed by Doers</a></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n","ayah/62-10.html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"id\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Tafsir Al-Jumu&#x27;a 62:10 — menurut Ibnu Taimiyah dan Ibnul Qayyim</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Apabila salat telah dilaksanakan, maka bertebaranlah kamu di bumi; carilah karunia Allah dan ingatlah Allah banyak-banyak agar kamu beruntung.\">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/ayah/62-10.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ar\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/62-10.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"